 "source": "the per-host admission ledger of the PREVIOUS boot, $XDG_STATE_HOME/crispdm/admission/ledger.jsonl, field readings.pressure_some_avg10 of every ADMISSION_* event in the window 2026-09-26T21:15:00Z..2026-09-26T21:28:00Z. No host name, address or account identifier appears in that file or in this one.",
 "what_this_is_not": "not a measurement made for this purpose and not a controlled experiment. It is the record of what the host did while two admitted scopes ran, read afterwards. No host was put under pressure to produce any number here and no threshold was tuned by trying it on a host.",
 "window_bound_deliberately": "the incident window of the previous boot only. Samples from the current boot are calm and would make the longest observed run of low pressure look arbitrarily long; the derivation must use the window in which the kills happened."
}